  "body": "Welcome to a relaxed, easy-care lifestyle where community spirit meets Independent living. Nestled in the heart of Puriri Park Retirement Village, this charming one-bedroom single-level home offers a warm and inviting ambiance. The spacious bedroom, generous living area, and functional kitchen provide comfortable everyday living, while the low-maintenance garden and private courtyard invite you to unwind in the sun.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this rare opportunity is the ownership structure: Puriri Park units are owned outright. This means you retain ownership of your property and benefit from any future capital gain, providing valuable financial clarity and security.\r\n\r\nThere is public transport at the gate and it’s just minutes away from Takapuna shops, beach, cafes and North Shore Hospital .\r\n\r\nPuriri Park offers a safe, caring community atmosphere in a location that keeps you connected. Best of all, you don't have to leave your furry friend behind—a pet cat is warmly welcomed here! Add in a handy enclosed porch for extra storage and a carport to protect your vehicle, and you have the ultimate recipe for stress-free retirement living.",
